rem Arranged Probability
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=100
rem Blue discs for the first total above
rem a limit with chance 1/2 of two blue

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Limit integer = 1000000000000

rem 2 b (b - 1) = n (n - 1) becomes the
rem Pell equation x^2 - 2 y^2 = -1 with
rem x = 2n - 1 and y = 2b - 1. Its
rem solutions are the odd powers of 1 +
rem sqrt 2, taken in reals and rounded.
Root = 2 sqrt
Odd = 1 to 61 by 2 array
Up = (1 + Root) ** Odd
Down = (1 - Root) ** Odd
X = (Up + Down) / 2
Y = (Up - Down) / (Root * 2)
All = ((X + 1) / 2) 0 round
Blue = ((Y + 1) / 2) 0 round
Past = All greater Limit
Answer = (Blue Past) first integer
Answer print
